WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.980
"Modern Archaeological Research Theory"
"A History of Japan"

00:00:02.980 --> 00:00:06.480
"Lightning Strikes related to Ken-no-Misaki?"

00:00:07.940 --> 00:00:10.400
Sw... Sw...

00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:12.800
Swallows... swallow...

00:00:13.450 --> 00:00:17.740
"The swallows and sparrows know
not the thoughts of geese and swans.

00:00:17.740 --> 00:00:23.460
Small birds like swallows and sparrows do
not understand what larger birds are thinking.

00:00:23.660 --> 00:00:24.670
In the same way,

00:00:24.670 --> 00:00:30.690
a small person cannot understand
the thoughts and plans of a

00:00:31.910 --> 00:00:33.020
great one"?

00:01:21.100 --> 00:01:22.860
Is this...?

00:01:25.310 --> 00:01:28.310
"Lightning Strikes related to Ken-no-Misaki?"

00:01:31.650 --> 00:01:33.630
I have to tell the others.

00:01:35.900 --> 00:01:37.980
I see. Understood.

00:01:38.530 --> 00:01:42.000
The media's found out about it.

00:01:43.040 --> 00:01:45.370
Yeah, this is a problem.

00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:49.310
I want you to put this fire out
before it gets bigger.

00:01:50.330 --> 00:01:53.960
Yeah. Feel free to get a little rough.

00:03:25.050 --> 00:03:30.230
"Episode 8:
The Swallows and Sparrows Know Not"

00:03:30.230 --> 00:03:31.270
Mio.

00:03:31.270 --> 00:03:34.100
How's school going? Is it fun?

00:03:34.100 --> 00:03:36.650
Yes. The classes are tough,

00:03:36.650 --> 00:03:38.480
but my club's a lot of fun.

00:03:38.480 --> 00:03:39.690
I see.

00:03:41.320 --> 00:03:44.610
Umm... I have a proposal for you.

00:03:45.030 --> 00:03:47.750
Would you be interested in going
to an international school?

00:03:48.990 --> 00:03:52.340
Things around here are 
going to be really busy.

00:03:52.750 --> 00:03:55.630
I've actually got all the paperwork ready.

00:03:55.630 --> 00:03:56.790
You can't...

00:03:56.790 --> 00:03:58.590
This is so sudden!

00:03:58.590 --> 00:04:02.680
You'll be starting next week
in an American school.

00:04:02.680 --> 00:04:04.180
You can't do that!

00:04:04.510 --> 00:04:09.310
I want to stay here... in Sakaimachi...

00:04:10.640 --> 00:04:13.650
The decision's already been made.

00:04:19.650 --> 00:04:21.430
My head hurts...

00:04:22.110 --> 00:04:25.200
Is it because of that
hypnosis-like stuff last night?

00:04:25.200 --> 00:04:26.320
Morning.

00:04:26.590 --> 00:04:27.910
Hangover?

00:04:27.910 --> 00:04:29.680
Of course not!

00:04:32.120 --> 00:04:34.250
Yeah, this isn't going to work.

00:04:34.920 --> 00:04:36.750
I'm going home.

00:04:36.750 --> 00:04:38.590
That's a shame...

00:04:38.590 --> 00:04:40.590
I thought this would be a great chance

00:04:40.590 --> 00:04:45.630
to try out my secret,
special headache-curing massage.

00:04:45.630 --> 00:04:47.930
Secret special massage?!

00:04:48.350 --> 00:04:55.640
It might make your whole body
feel better, not just your head...

00:04:57.310 --> 00:04:58.310
How about it?

00:05:00.980 --> 00:05:03.490
I'm in, of course!

00:05:03.490 --> 00:05:04.860
Let's do this!

00:05:04.860 --> 00:05:07.820
Let's head to the bed in the nurse's office.

00:05:11.990 --> 00:05:15.120
I found it in the principal's closet.

00:05:15.120 --> 00:05:18.710
I'll put it back when we're done,
so don't tell him about it.

00:05:18.710 --> 00:05:21.000
Is that why it's secret?

00:05:22.090 --> 00:05:23.920
Anyway...

00:05:23.920 --> 00:05:28.300
Eriko-<i>sensei</i>, have you ever heard
of something like Nai-herb? Or al-hab?

00:05:28.300 --> 00:05:30.010
Niarb?

00:05:30.010 --> 00:05:31.010
Yeah, that's it.

00:05:31.220 --> 00:05:32.550
Niarb.

00:05:32.930 --> 00:05:35.230
It's a type of hypnosis.

00:05:35.230 --> 00:05:36.730
A type?

00:05:37.310 --> 00:05:39.610
What separates it from regular hypnosis

00:05:39.610 --> 00:05:43.420
is that your normal
consciousness remains awake.

00:05:45.240 --> 00:05:47.740
It's a state of hypnosis
where since you're awake,

00:05:47.740 --> 00:05:51.620
you don't realize you're being controlled.

00:05:54.790 --> 00:05:56.410
Come in.

00:05:57.620 --> 00:05:59.790
Oh, Hatano-<i>kun</i>?

00:05:59.790 --> 00:06:01.840
I'm not feeling well.

00:06:01.840 --> 00:06:03.670
Please let me rest here for a while.

00:06:03.670 --> 00:06:06.880
How about a special massage, Kanna-<i>chan</i>?

00:06:07.550 --> 00:06:09.130
I'll pass.

00:06:09.130 --> 00:06:15.470
Oh yeah? How about a
super great hyper massage, then?

00:06:27.900 --> 00:06:29.110
Sheesh...

00:06:29.110 --> 00:06:31.680
That didn't make me feel better at all.

00:06:32.410 --> 00:06:34.910
What's not feeling better?

00:06:35.330 --> 00:06:36.730
Mitsuki-<i>san</i>?

00:06:37.500 --> 00:06:40.500
One part of me is feeling better now.

00:06:40.500 --> 00:06:43.380
Your crotch, right?

00:06:43.380 --> 00:06:44.800
That's my Mitsuki-<i>san</i>.

00:06:44.800 --> 00:06:46.760
You know how I think.

00:06:46.760 --> 00:06:49.130
Did you look into what I asked you to?

00:06:49.550 --> 00:06:50.440
Yeah.

00:06:51.470 --> 00:06:55.060
Mitsuki-<i>san</i>, you said
your head hurt yesterday, right?

00:06:55.060 --> 00:06:57.150
Yes. Why?

00:06:57.730 --> 00:07:03.270
It's possible that both you and I
were hypnotized by Ryuzoji-<i>sensei</i>.

00:07:03.270 --> 00:07:04.820
He hypnotized us?

00:07:04.820 --> 00:07:06.230
That's ridiculous.

00:07:10.820 --> 00:07:15.110
You're the person you
always are right now, right?

00:07:17.580 --> 00:07:19.240
Of course.

00:07:20.000 --> 00:07:25.270
But you feel different than before.

00:07:26.590 --> 00:07:30.230
Like you're another person, 
from another world.

00:07:31.430 --> 00:07:35.510
Well, that's because
I was a virgin before I met you.

00:07:35.850 --> 00:07:38.010
Sex changes a boy, you know?

00:07:39.100 --> 00:07:40.600
Is that really true, I wonder?

00:07:43.440 --> 00:07:46.020
Hey, how are things with you and that girl?

00:07:46.020 --> 00:07:47.450
Shimazu-<i>san</i>?

00:07:49.030 --> 00:07:50.820
She hates me now.

00:07:52.110 --> 00:07:57.580
After that, she started
calling me "walking libido."

00:07:58.950 --> 00:08:01.370
Crap! I've gotta get to class.

00:08:02.920 --> 00:08:05.540
If I'm late, she'll yell at me again.

00:08:06.210 --> 00:08:08.840
I'll get in touch with 
you later about Ryuzoji.

00:08:09.510 --> 00:08:10.200
Okay.

00:08:12.380 --> 00:08:13.470
Thanks.

00:08:14.720 --> 00:08:16.550
What's wrong?

00:08:16.550 --> 00:08:18.670
You look down, Shimazu-<i>san</i>.

00:08:19.260 --> 00:08:20.680
It's nothing.

00:08:20.680 --> 00:08:24.650
If you're having problems, leave it to me!

00:08:24.650 --> 00:08:26.860
Especially romance problems!

00:08:26.860 --> 00:08:31.690
It's not like that, but sure,
maybe I can tell you.

00:08:31.690 --> 00:08:33.020
Of course!

00:08:34.150 --> 00:08:35.740
Do you have some time too, Arima-<i>kun</i>?

00:08:36.780 --> 00:08:37.780
For what?

00:08:37.990 --> 00:08:39.950
I want to go to Mt. Sankaku and check it out.

00:08:39.950 --> 00:08:41.420
Sometime in the next week.

00:08:42.580 --> 00:08:44.210
Stop by my place on your way home.

00:08:44.210 --> 00:08:47.330
I discovered something
about that tapestry from yesterday.

00:08:47.330 --> 00:08:50.300
But why does it have to be within a week?

00:08:50.300 --> 00:08:54.020
I want to solve the mystery of
Mt. Sankaku as soon as possible!

00:08:54.680 --> 00:08:58.520
It's better to stay from that mountain.

00:08:58.930 --> 00:09:00.220
Why?

00:09:00.220 --> 00:09:04.080
Do you know something about Mt. Sankaku?

00:09:04.770 --> 00:09:08.110
Okay, sit down everybody.

00:09:08.190 --> 00:09:09.690
"Summer School Math 3"

00:09:10.270 --> 00:09:12.880
You're doing something special today.

00:09:13.440 --> 00:09:16.700
It's not like yesterday where you
just turn it in fast and you're done.

00:09:16.700 --> 00:09:20.290
You're doing it over and over again
until you get every problem right.

00:09:20.580 --> 00:09:23.200
Got it, Arima?

00:09:23.580 --> 00:09:25.410
Sure, Sensei...

00:09:31.460 --> 00:09:32.420
How?

00:09:32.420 --> 00:09:34.590
Ok, see you later!

00:09:34.590 --> 00:09:35.840
This is going to take forever...

00:09:35.840 --> 00:09:37.340
It'll take forever!

00:09:37.340 --> 00:09:39.350
Boss!

00:09:39.760 --> 00:09:41.640
He'll be busy for a while.

00:09:41.640 --> 00:09:43.270
Let's leave without him.

00:09:43.270 --> 00:09:44.270
Okay.

00:09:52.020 --> 00:09:56.780
You've sure spent a lot of time on this, huh?

00:09:56.780 --> 00:09:59.110
Dr. Arima's book, <i>Legacy</i>,

00:09:59.110 --> 00:10:01.080
said that the secrets
of the Takanoamahara people

00:10:01.080 --> 00:10:04.060
could be found here in Sakaimachi, right?

00:10:04.410 --> 00:10:05.230
Yeah.

00:10:06.040 --> 00:10:09.670
The book didn't refer to a specific location.

00:10:09.670 --> 00:10:14.420
"An Introduction to the Takanoamahara People"

00:10:10.080 --> 00:10:13.830
But if you read it closely,
there's one location that suggests itself.

00:10:14.420 --> 00:10:16.220
Where's that?

00:10:16.220 --> 00:10:19.190
Ken-no-Misaki. Mt. Sankaku.

00:10:19.800 --> 00:10:22.310
Remember Futago Rock?

00:10:24.850 --> 00:10:26.930
Before I remember that big round rock,

00:10:27.480 --> 00:10:30.770
there are some other
big round things I'd have to see.

00:10:31.190 --> 00:10:33.900
I need a good look...

00:10:33.900 --> 00:10:35.400
Stop messing around.

00:10:36.240 --> 00:10:37.740
I said this before,

00:10:37.740 --> 00:10:42.740
but there's a good chance that the
writing on Futago Rock is 8,000 years old.

00:10:42.740 --> 00:10:46.810
I think it might have been written
by the Takanoamahara People.

00:10:48.080 --> 00:10:50.080
The Takanoamahara People?

00:10:57.210 --> 00:10:59.170
What's wrong, Arima-<i>kun</i>?

00:10:59.590 --> 00:11:05.640
Nothing... I was just wondering if any of
the Takanoamahara people were blonde girls.

00:11:05.640 --> 00:11:09.180
Blonde? You mean European?

00:11:09.520 --> 00:11:13.110
That's right.
And maybe they had pointy ears?

00:11:13.110 --> 00:11:14.260
Ears...?

00:11:15.150 --> 00:11:16.280
And were stark naked!

00:11:18.490 --> 00:11:19.650
You're disgusting!

00:11:32.290 --> 00:11:38.800
"With the Most Beloved"

00:11:43.470 --> 00:11:44.350
Yes.

00:11:44.350 --> 00:11:46.010
You're still home?

00:11:46.010 --> 00:11:47.330
What are you doing?

00:11:47.970 --> 00:11:49.220
I'm sorry.

00:11:49.220 --> 00:11:50.640
I had something to do.

00:11:50.640 --> 00:11:54.610
Hey, you're supposed
to be with me today, right?

00:11:57.320 --> 00:11:58.780
Answer me.

00:11:58.780 --> 00:12:01.950
If you're not coming here, I can go to you.

00:12:03.910 --> 00:12:05.530
Hey, are you listening?

00:12:07.330 --> 00:12:08.450
Understood.

00:12:09.450 --> 00:12:10.770
I'll be right over.

00:12:14.540 --> 00:12:19.300
Anyway, I'm sure there's
something at Mt. Sankaku.

00:12:19.880 --> 00:12:24.260
The tapestry I saw at Principal Ryuzoji's
house yesterday proves it!

00:12:24.260 --> 00:12:25.610
That thing?

00:12:26.180 --> 00:12:27.990
Look at this!

00:12:28.680 --> 00:12:32.060
Don't you think it reminds you
of the lightning strikes on the coast?

00:12:32.770 --> 00:12:35.850
I guess... now that you mention it.

00:12:36.190 --> 00:12:41.990
Remember what you said?
That this was some kind of symbol.

00:12:41.990 --> 00:12:44.600
Symbol of what, I don't know.

00:12:45.240 --> 00:12:48.490
And that's what we're going to find out!

00:12:49.330 --> 00:12:51.500
I'm going to get ready. Give me a minute.

00:12:51.500 --> 00:12:53.060
Take your time.

00:12:56.710 --> 00:12:58.990
Mio, do you have a second?

00:13:00.840 --> 00:13:01.740
Hey...

00:13:06.680 --> 00:13:08.710
Somebody's at the door...

00:13:11.970 --> 00:13:13.020
What's wrong?

00:13:13.020 --> 00:13:14.860
Did something happen, Mio?

00:13:16.020 --> 00:13:18.400
Did I just hear a boy's voice?

00:13:21.190 --> 00:13:23.030
Mio, I'm coming inside!

00:13:25.240 --> 00:13:27.160
It's nothing, Dad!

00:13:27.160 --> 00:13:28.950
Just a cockroach!

00:13:28.950 --> 00:13:30.740
That hurt!

00:13:31.160 --> 00:13:33.040
How many times have you hit me today?

00:13:34.540 --> 00:13:35.960
Whose voice is that?

00:13:35.960 --> 00:13:37.610
Is there a boy in there?

00:13:38.750 --> 00:13:41.040
No, it was my voice!

00:13:42.880 --> 00:13:46.550
Arima-<i>kun</i>, if my dad
finds you you're done for!

00:13:46.550 --> 00:13:49.680
If he finds out I let a boy
into my room, he'll kill you!

00:13:52.140 --> 00:13:53.100
--Just get out of here...

00:13:53.100 --> 00:13:55.140
--Mio, move!
--Just get out of here...

00:13:57.560 --> 00:14:00.400
Open the door, now!

00:14:00.400 --> 00:14:01.820
Wait, Dad!

00:14:01.820 --> 00:14:03.730
I'm getting dressed!

00:14:03.730 --> 00:14:05.280
Move!

00:14:05.280 --> 00:14:06.570
No!

00:14:06.570 --> 00:14:08.530
I said move!

00:14:11.950 --> 00:14:14.080
I think someone's at the door, Dad!

00:14:14.080 --> 00:14:17.250
I'm fine, so go answer it!

00:14:17.250 --> 00:14:18.750
But...

00:14:21.960 --> 00:14:23.170
I'll be back in a minute!

00:14:23.170 --> 00:14:24.480
Stay put!

00:14:26.300 --> 00:14:27.760
Now! Run!

00:14:28.510 --> 00:14:30.970
Go to Mt. Sankaku and wait for me!

00:14:30.970 --> 00:14:32.510
But this is the second floor...

00:14:32.510 --> 00:14:33.400
Hurry!

00:14:38.230 --> 00:14:39.050
Hello?

00:14:40.480 --> 00:14:42.270
My name is Yuki!

00:14:42.270 --> 00:14:45.030
I go to Sakaimachi Academy
along with Mio-<i>san</i>...

00:14:47.070 --> 00:14:48.680
Thanks!

00:14:51.280 --> 00:14:52.450
Leave.

00:14:55.540 --> 00:14:57.080
That was Yuki?

00:14:57.080 --> 00:14:58.320
Whew.

00:15:20.940 --> 00:15:23.450
Arima-<i>kun</i>, I made it.

00:15:24.980 --> 00:15:26.820
You forgot your shoes.

00:15:27.230 --> 00:15:29.580
Forget that. What are you carrying?

00:15:30.360 --> 00:15:31.390
We're digging!

00:15:33.490 --> 00:15:34.740
Look at this.

00:15:34.740 --> 00:15:36.300
That's the drawing you made.

00:15:36.910 --> 00:15:40.980
What is this part... this hole in the tower?

00:15:43.210 --> 00:15:47.500
If it's really a tower,
then that would be the entrance.

00:15:47.500 --> 00:15:48.670
Yeah.

00:15:48.670 --> 00:15:52.130
I think there's an entrance around here.

00:15:54.470 --> 00:15:59.470
But do you really think there's
anything left to be found here?

00:16:00.390 --> 00:16:03.230
Nobody else in his field
believed Dr. Arima, right?

00:16:05.270 --> 00:16:10.490
It's possible that his research was
just ignored and never widely published.

00:16:10.740 --> 00:16:12.450
I don't know...

00:16:12.450 --> 00:16:16.490
Well, even if he did tell people that
the secrets of the Takanoamahara people

00:16:16.490 --> 00:16:18.040
were hidden in Mt. Sankaku,

00:16:18.040 --> 00:16:20.620
they'd just laugh at him.

00:16:27.920 --> 00:16:31.420
Wouldn't it be faster to just say
the magic words to open the door?

00:16:31.920 --> 00:16:34.300
I would, if we knew them.

00:16:37.260 --> 00:16:41.390
Munyah munyah, open sesame!

00:16:47.110 --> 00:16:48.260
I knew it!

00:16:49.150 --> 00:16:50.070
Arima-<i>kun</i>!

00:16:50.530 --> 00:16:51.520
What is it?

00:16:52.280 --> 00:16:54.270
The sound it makes here is different.

00:16:55.610 --> 00:16:57.160
Look, here!

00:16:59.580 --> 00:17:00.200
Mio!

00:17:01.580 --> 00:17:02.980
Did you sprain it?

00:17:03.500 --> 00:17:04.710
I'm okay.

00:17:04.710 --> 00:17:05.870
It's nothing.

00:17:06.960 --> 00:17:08.790
You can't do this with that ankle.

00:17:08.790 --> 00:17:11.460
I'm fine! It's nothing!

00:17:11.460 --> 00:17:12.640
Mio!

00:17:14.050 --> 00:17:15.550
Don't force yourself to do this.

00:17:15.550 --> 00:17:17.620
We should go home for today.

00:17:19.050 --> 00:17:21.060
We can come back tomorrow.

00:17:23.730 --> 00:17:24.510
Yeah...

00:17:37.910 --> 00:17:39.330
You've put on weight, haven't you?

00:17:40.280 --> 00:17:41.870
I have not!

00:17:41.870 --> 00:17:43.200
I'm kidding.

00:17:47.330 --> 00:17:48.330
What?

00:17:48.330 --> 00:17:50.750
They're about an 83, or an 84.

00:17:50.750 --> 00:17:51.960
Your breasts.

00:17:51.960 --> 00:17:53.590
Let me down!

00:17:53.590 --> 00:17:55.200
Don't fidget!

00:18:03.560 --> 00:18:05.350
Does your ankle hurt?

00:18:05.350 --> 00:18:06.490
A little.

00:18:08.020 --> 00:18:09.760
Will you be okay until
we get to the nurse's office?

00:18:10.360 --> 00:18:11.050
Yeah.

00:18:12.150 --> 00:18:14.740
Arima-<i>kun</i>, I'm sorry.

00:18:14.740 --> 00:18:16.200
Don't worry about it.

00:18:22.910 --> 00:18:24.620
Eriko-<i>sensei</i>?

00:18:25.080 --> 00:18:28.000
Well, she wouldn't be here at this hour.

00:18:41.550 --> 00:18:44.170
You can do anything, huh, Arima-<i>kun</i>?

00:18:45.020 --> 00:18:47.390
My dad taught me when I was little.

00:18:48.350 --> 00:18:51.610
Boss... Shimazu-<i>san</i>...

00:18:51.610 --> 00:18:53.860
Where did you go?

00:18:58.320 --> 00:18:59.990
Let's go home.

00:19:01.530 --> 00:19:03.950
What's wrong?
Why are you staring at the sky?

00:19:04.990 --> 00:19:06.540
When I look into the starry sky,

00:19:06.540 --> 00:19:10.040
it makes me realize how small I am.

00:19:10.040 --> 00:19:11.210
What's this about?

00:19:11.210 --> 00:19:13.710
If something's bothering you, tell me.

00:19:14.670 --> 00:19:17.260
I might not be as good as the starry sky,

00:19:17.260 --> 00:19:19.530
but maybe I can make you 
feel a little better.

00:19:20.800 --> 00:19:24.720
My dad's involved in some kind of corruption.

00:19:24.720 --> 00:19:26.180
You mean...

00:19:26.180 --> 00:19:30.640
Something involving
the Geotech construction project.

00:19:32.520 --> 00:19:36.780
I'm probably leaving Sakaimachi.

00:19:37.690 --> 00:19:40.150
My dad's telling me I need to study overseas.

00:19:40.610 --> 00:19:42.780
But you've got nothing to do with it!

00:19:42.780 --> 00:19:44.440
It's your dad's problem!

00:19:45.490 --> 00:19:46.990
Thank you...

00:19:48.080 --> 00:19:53.420
If only everybody was like you, Arima-<i>kun</i>.

00:19:56.630 --> 00:19:57.840
Oh?

00:19:57.840 --> 00:20:00.010
I came because I heard some voices...

00:20:00.010 --> 00:20:02.130
Am I interrupting something?

00:20:02.130 --> 00:20:05.430
No, but you're not welcome, either.

00:20:06.640 --> 00:20:08.020
Sorry.

00:20:08.020 --> 00:20:11.730
But I'm glad I didn't catch you
in the middle of something.

00:20:11.730 --> 00:20:14.440
I wouldn't do anything so disgusting.

00:20:14.440 --> 00:20:16.480
Unlike a certain someone.

00:20:16.480 --> 00:20:21.280
Oh? Is it "disgusting"
to share your love with someone?

00:20:22.990 --> 00:20:24.450
I'm sorry.

00:20:25.120 --> 00:20:30.040
But I'm sure that 6 months ago,
that's how it looked to you.

00:20:30.290 --> 00:20:37.130
You even came to me after that
and told me to break up with Arima-<i>kun</i>.

00:20:37.130 --> 00:20:40.920
How could you say that?
You promised not to tell him!

00:20:41.130 --> 00:20:45.300
But I think it's better that he know.

00:20:45.300 --> 00:20:46.790
What does that mean?

00:20:47.550 --> 00:20:51.470
You like Arima-<i>kun</i>, don't you?

00:20:52.640 --> 00:20:54.690
Don't be ridiculous!

00:20:54.690 --> 00:20:57.940
How could I love a walking 
libido like this guy?

00:20:57.940 --> 00:20:59.220
I'm right, aren't I?

00:21:00.070 --> 00:21:03.490
The fact that you're getting
so emotional proves it.

00:21:05.820 --> 00:21:07.430
Anyway, it's late.

00:21:07.700 --> 00:21:11.540
Takuya, take her home.

00:21:17.880 --> 00:21:19.990
Sorry... I guess...

00:21:20.550 --> 00:21:22.600
It's fine.

00:21:44.530 --> 00:21:46.040
I can't believe you!

00:21:47.070 --> 00:21:50.240
I can't believe you'd do something like this!

00:22:00.040 --> 00:22:02.800
"We denounce Mayor Shimazu!!"

00:22:02.800 --> 00:22:04.160
What is this?

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:41.530
"Episode 9: The Distance Between Him and Her"

00:23:35.720 --> 00:23:38.970
Episode 9: "The Distance 
Between Him and Her."
